{"id":"vod_zy360_66049","vodId":"66049","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"飞翔的魔女","name_cn":"飞翔的魔女","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241018-1/64324760781e899912a1f623ca318715.jpg"},"summary":"木幡真琴（篠田南配音）是一名见习魔女，同时亦是一名十五岁的高中一年级女生。魔女界有一个约定俗成的规矩，那就是在十五岁成人礼之后，魔女们便要走上社会开始独自生活，进行魔女的修行。如此，真琴孤身一人来到了青森县，居住在堂兄仓本圭（菅原慎介配音）家中，转入了这里的高中，开始了崭新的生活。在这里，真琴结识了许多善良的朋友们，天真可爱对魔女稍稍有些害怕的仓木千夏（铃木绘里配音）、家中经营着酒铺的石渡直（三上枝织配音）、误食了魔法药而在白天会变成狗面的犬养（日野麻里配音）、和母亲与幽灵雏（金元寿子配音）一起经营咖啡店的椎名杏子（井口裕香配音）。在这些朋友们的陪伴下，有笑有泪的剧目拉开了序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-18 14:08:48","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/mo5SCb4m/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/t8Rqby1f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/gWzcaBET/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/d6C4ehty/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/YYkpsLIo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/wMkb3reJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/eSwafmLP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/jUeYgiNC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/yIW5AtxW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/8lw9tou2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/d1Ff7fOy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/ZoVZmmXx/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:50.373Z"}